%% Request lifecycle: one invocation through Loop Engineering, including pause and resume.
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Caller
  participant A as Agent
  participant L as Loop Engineering
  participant X as Execution
  C->>A: invoke(input, config)
  A->>L: start the loop
  loop each iteration
    L->>X: task + loop context
    Note over X: route capabilities<br/>select DIRECT<br/>or a topology<br/>run it
    X-->>L: result or error
    Note over L: observe<br/>evaluate the objective<br/>decide
    Note over L: continue · retry · replan<br/>change topology · refresh<br/>run the next iteration
  end
  alt finished
    L-->>A: result + LoopState
    A-->>C: answer, or raises the failure
  else paused
    L-->>A: interrupts (checkpointed)
    A-->>C: raises ExecutionPaused
    C->>A: resume(config, value)
    A->>L: continue from the checkpoint
  end
